  annotation "note_1771582810925_1", anchor: "the practice's essential catalyst is not fire-core heat but the resonance of **The Dreaming Tooth**", text: "Nine practitioners across multiple sites and eras. One artifact, held by orcas at the Corpse Current. Either the Tooth's resonance operates at distances this entry declines to specify, or initial contact imprints permanently, or several of these practitioners never performed Shawl☽ Sun at all and appear on the list because fable tradition does not distinguish between a practitioner registry and a dramatis personae.", type: :skepticism, display: :full, source_anchor: "the practice's essential catalyst is not fire-core heat but the resonance of The Dreaming Tooth"
  annotation "note_1771582810925_2", anchor: "corrupted ice at Terrace Momiou", text: "My Terrace Momiou annotation flags wards in the scaffolding ice predating the Great Thaw — built by someone I cannot identify. If ☽'Saetacaeia-Viamana~ burned that site's corrupted ice, she may have destroyed the only record of whoever built there first. The discovery of Shawl☽ Sun doubling as its first act of irreversible archival damage. It rhymes.", type: :correction, display: :popout
